  "notes": "FORMS:\n- Adverbial: {分厚|ぶあつ}く\n- Noun form: {分厚|ぶあつ}さ (thickness)\n- Negative: {分厚|ぶあつ}くない\n\nETYMOLOGY:\n{分|ぶ} (emphatic prefix) + {厚|あつ}い (thick). The prefix adds emphasis, making {分厚|ぶあつ}い stronger than {厚|あつ}い alone.\n\nUSAGE:\nUsed for physical thickness of objects like books, steaks, walls, and clothing. Not used for abstract thickness or for temperature ({暑|あつ}い).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {分厚|ぶあつ}い{本|ほん}: thick book\n- {分厚|ぶあつ}い{辞書|じしょ}: thick dictionary\n- {分厚|ぶあつ}い{肉|にく}: thick-cut meat\n- {分厚|ぶあつ}い{壁|かべ}: thick wall",
